  "notes": "A 3d cube screen from Framework7's kitchen sink, shown with Framework7's iOS or Material (Android) theme. Framework7 builds mobile apps (and PWAs / Capacitor apps) from HTML.\n\nUse: npm i framework7, then the same markup inside a Framework7 app. Docs: https://framework7.io/docs/",
